[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3075292315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108641#issuecomment-3075292315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108641","id":3075292315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63TTyb","user":{"login":"mieldepoche","id":71937306,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTM3MzA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71937306?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche","html_url":"https://github.com/mieldepoche","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T19:49:35Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T19:49:46Z","body":"afaik `:=` is inference, if not what else would be?\n\n```gdscript\nvar inferred := 0\nvar explicit: int = 0\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3075292315/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3075792954","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108641#issuecomment-3075792954","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108641","id":3075792954,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63VOA6","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T21:38:28Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T21:38:28Z","body":"`:=` is indeed what's called type inference. It's equivalent to `auto` in C++.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3075792954/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3076000360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108641#issuecomment-3076000360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108641","id":3076000360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63WApo","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T23:02:39Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T23:02:39Z","body":"then there's no difference between `=` and `:=`\n\nwhat makes `:=` different is the variable cannot be asigned a value of a different type\n```\nvar i := 0\ni = \"a\"\n# Error\n```\n\nThat is kinda the hole point of typing, sometimes i like to use := with some variant tyles like Vector2, Vector3, PackedInt32Array, etc because is kinda useless to repeat them in the line of code, i guess i will just disable the warning?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3076000360/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3076770061","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108641#issuecomment-3076770061","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108641","id":3076770061,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63Y8kN","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-16T05:10:11Z","updated_at":"2025-07-16T05:10:11Z","body":"In this case, yes, you should disable the inferred typing warning. From the default debug settings, I personally set `untyped_declaration` to error, but leave `inferred_declaration` to ignore, as I want to be able to type things such as:\n```gdscript\nvar a := 0.0\nvar b := Vector3(1, 2, 3)\n```\nWith `inferred_declaration` as a warning, you would instead need to type:\n```gdscript\nvar a: float = 0\nvar b: Vector3 = Vector3(1, 2, 3)\n```\nAlso keep in mind that some variables still require explicit typing, like typed arrays and dictionaries, which will otherwise be inferred as untyped arrays/dictionaries.\n\n> then there's no difference between `=` and `:=`\n\nThere is a difference: `:=` infers the type of the variable automatically from the value of the variable:\n```gdscript\nvar a := 0  # int, same result as typing var a: int = 0\nvar b := 0.0  # float, same result as typing var b: float = 0\nvar c = 0.0  # Variant (no inferred declaration), same result as var c: Variant = 0.0\n```\nYou also need to explicitly type your variable if you actually want a Variant type (depending on warnings/errors set, but I believe this is enabled by default):\n```gdscript\nvar a: Variant = true\nvar b := some_function_returning_a_variant() as Variant  # error, needs explicit typing\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3076770061/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]